{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_05_beg","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":10,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_04_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-5","storyName":"溺火","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"拉芙希妮得到“放逐王”的帮助，穿越了黑林的封锁，与先前分开的友人们重逢。遗迹中，守灵人拒绝了拉芙希妮的未尽之言，但接受了为逝者举办葬礼的请求。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_05","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":8,"next":10,"characters":["拉芙希妮","？？？","“放逐王”","莫兰","塔拉流民","严肃的守灵人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......先前遇上的那个，难道又是捉弄人的幻影？路是错的，我好像又走回来了。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"也看不清天色，不知道走了多久......还有多远。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"但我至少没像布莉吉说的那样，被黑雾和噪声挡在黑林之外，我至少进来了。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"还是这些爱捉弄人的精怪，会指给你错路的幻影，故意牵来枝条绊倒人的羽兽......倒是和我带莫兰他们回来时差不多。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"也许是这些树木长得太高，也太茂密。它们遮住了天空，让这里面的生命与外界不同。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":24},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......没走错路。这里就是黑林的中心了。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"总感觉......这里的景色也和我来的时候不一样......那些代表秋天的金红色呢，为什么都消失了？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"为什么里头变成现在这样了？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":37},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blacksmoke_01","fade":"true","fadetime":"1.5","layer":"2","id":38},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"是黑雾？！","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"也就是说，黑林到底还是拒绝了我，是吗？","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"charslot","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮紧紧握住手中的武器。假如真的如涅梅丝所说，深池离开城市之后就再也没有回来，被黑雾吞噬的确是他们最可能的下场。","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"但黑雾并无攻击她的迹象，只是停在原地。","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"它是在......拒绝我吗？","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不，与其说是拒绝，倒不如说是冷漠......失望？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"为什么？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"除了植物婆娑的晃动之外，没有任何能被认成回答的声响。","id":57},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮摇摇头，谨慎地经过黑雾身侧，选择了尽头看起来有光亮的一条路，而黑雾仍然对她的通过无动于衷。","id":58},{"type":"text","text":"那些乐于把人带上歧途的精怪，此刻也不见踪影。","id":59},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"charslot","id":63},{"type":"bgeffect","id":64},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":66},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blacksmoke_01","layer":"1","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":69},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","duration":"1.5","id":71},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不行，又是死路......","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"没时间在这里逗留了。抱歉，我得烧出一条路来——","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"charslot","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"那你可真是想太多了。","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"谁？！","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$1","duration":"1.5","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"你觉得呢？","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"怎么会是......你？","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"在城里的那位......先生。上次我就有问题要问你，但你却——","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"上次见面确实算得上是不欢而散，不告而别。后面我也跟了你一路，看了你一路，就当是反思了。","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"总之，我得承认你和我想的不太一样，但现在还不是闲聊的时候。","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"别烧那些树木，只用你的火照亮它们就行了，看看它们到底是什么东西。","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“是什么东西”......？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":96},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_1","id":97},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"叶片锋利，荆棘坚硬，枝条上甚至反射出金属的冷光？这究竟是？！","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"是什么不重要，你的火不可能将其烧穿，这才是重点。","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"跟我来。","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"在黑雾改了主意之前，跟我来！","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"我再晚一会儿跟你搭话，那东西一个心情不好，你就被直接吞了，骨头渣子也不剩。","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"可那边不是死路吗？","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"为什么觉得眼见的东西就一定为实呢？","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"听我的，走！","id":114},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"charslot","id":118},{"type":"bgeffect","id":119},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":123},{"type":"playsound","key":"$runsand","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这是......我来纳斯尔纱时走的那条路！","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"刚刚那些小路居然通向这里？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"先生，虽然冒昧，但您和林中的精怪......","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"别傻了，我怎么会和它们扯上关系。","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"倒是这片树林，几百年过去了，除了多了一层黑雾以外，里面居然还是这副样子......","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"呵，煞风景。","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"再往前几步就算是出了黑林，不知道您能否——","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"啧啧啧，这可真是......","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"出什么事了？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“放逐王”","text":"看你身后。","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"charslot","id":146},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":147},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"苇草！","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"苇草，我们来了！","id":151},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$runsand","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":155},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"流民们的身影出现在黑林明亮的边缘。","id":158},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":159,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"城里是不是出了什么事？自从你进城之后，黑雾就像是突然发怒了一样，将城市和外界严密地隔开，黑林已经好几天没人出入了。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"刚才有人去黑林外围打猎，听见林子里有响动，有人声，还有火光什么的。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"之前也出过类似的事，守灵人让我们不要靠近黑林，小心惹祸上身。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"但这一次我们都认出来了，那是你的火。我们必须得过来。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这里太危险了——","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"那也不该放任你一个人去承担所有的危险。伦蒂尼姆郊外那次，我们在沼泽地等你的时候，大家就已经明白了。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"我们信任你，你也该信任我们。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我很感激。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"这不算什么。我们先回聚落吧。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"嗯。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"先生，不知道您——","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1690_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":183},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"苇草，怎么了？你在对谁说话？还有人跟着你从黑林里出来吗？","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"charslot","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"红龙回身看去，那个不请自来的男人，就像是阳光下的露珠一样不见了踪影。","id":190},{"type":"dialog","id":191},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":192},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"bgeffect","id":196},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":197},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":198},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":199,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"感谢你们为这些人提供了住所，守灵人。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"涅梅丝将他们托付给我们，这就是我们应该做的。","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"那么，拉芙希妮小姐，守灵人承诺不将您的存在泄露给任何不知情的人。既然您已经确认了这些人的安危，我们可以就此分开了。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"这是什么意思？难道你们不欢迎她？","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"莫兰，你们也一样。","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"两条红龙之间总会产生无尽的纷争。如果你们擅自介入两条红龙之间的争斗，那我们也无力再为你们提供庇护。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"你们怎么这样？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"我们一向如此。守灵人既不挑起冲突，也不试图消弭冲突。","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"生者的争端非我们所能干涉，我们只守望逝者的灵魂。","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"红龙，如果您真的如莫兰等人所说，是一位悲悯而高尚的领导者，那您就更不该将这些无辜的人卷入您的斗争。","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这不是两条红龙之间的争斗，我是为了纳斯尔纱的居民来向你们求助——","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"斗争总有理由。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"苇草不是一个会找借口的人。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"即便不是借口，生者的纠纷也与我们无关......这是我们至今仍在为之品尝苦果的教训。","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"请回吧。","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"就算我来请你们安葬一位逝者......也不行吗？","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"安葬逝者？","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"如果的确如此，守灵人的营地会向您敞开，但也仅限葬礼。","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"烦请告诉我逝者的姓名，事迹，还有......请把他的亡骸交给我们。","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"他叫......库林，城里的铁匠。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"库林？！","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"他的死因是什么？","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"他被紫色的死火夺取了生命与意志，即便是我的火焰......也无法再拯救他。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"......","id":242},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"那为什么从所谓独立到现在，没有一个纳斯尔纱人来找我们，让我们帮城内的逝者举行一场符合传统的葬礼呢？","id":250},{"type":"dialog","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"原来......","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"战争结束后，第一个得到哀悼的纳斯尔纱人......甚至没有死在那场战争中。","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"bgeffect","id":265},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":267},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"像这样......把干草扎成环？","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"没错，然后把这些花卉装饰在上面，编成花环就行了。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"记得我们在路上也有这么一次，农民们把花环戴在你头上，祈求来年风调雨顺。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......嗯。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"真怀念啊，感觉又回到那个时候了。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"在这里住得不开心？","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"我自己倒是很自在，但其他人可能多少会觉得有些拘束吧。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"因为守灵人的生活就像在和自己过不去嘛。莫兰，你那个词是怎么说的来着，“苦修”？","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"不喝酒，不开宴会，不吃过分烹饪的东西，甚至不会大声说笑。每天从天不亮起床开始，直到半夜睡下，无论做什么都有仪式。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"虽然他们不用这一套来要求我们，但我们毕竟也得帮人家干干农活什么的，总是要打交道的。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"这几天住下来，我都觉得自己快要不会笑了，哈哈。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"只有莫兰每天都会去找守灵人说话，每天都能学一点东西回来。今天是绳结的编法，明天是如何估算树木寿命之类的。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"这倒是没错，不过和那些故事中的守灵人相比......","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"charslot","id":292},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"红龙阁下？","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"守灵人女士。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"没想到您会在这里与他们一同劳作。","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_242","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔拉流民","text":"苇草一直都是这样啊。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_242.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"唔。","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_728_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫兰","text":"需要我们回避吗？","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_728_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1691_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"不，我只是为了仪式需要，来确认死者的生平。","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的守灵人","text":"请告诉我，红龙，这段时间里，库林身上究竟发生了什么？","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我会一五一十地把我见到的一切告诉你，守灵人。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"希望这些事能对你有所触动。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":318},{"type":"charslot","id":319},{"type":"background","id":320},{"type":"image","id":321}],"characters":["拉芙希妮","？？？","“放逐王”","莫兰","塔拉流民","严肃的守灵人"]}